          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Eta point comfortably above threshold: W = 1.52 GeV, Q2 = 0.6, cos theta* = -0.4, phi* = 45.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_088a779760011yUhlUhbcd2HIP",
          "sessionID": "ses_f7758869fffe2QATlLcPz6lLG0",
          "messageID": "msg_088a779740016d2euPPgaT76BR"
